  "businessStatements": [
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B01",
      "text": "Selektiert werden gezählte, noch nicht als Differenz gebuchte und nicht gelöschte Inventurpositionen der gewählten Werke und Belege.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 5,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B02",
      "text": "Jede Position wird mit dem Bewertungspreis bewertet: gleitender Durchschnittspreis oder Standardpreis je Preissteuerung; ohne Preis bleibt der Wert 0.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 16,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:16"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 18,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:18"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 23,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:23"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 24,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:24"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B03",
      "text": "Gibt es keine Differenzen, endet der Lauf mit einer Meldung.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 41,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:41"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 42,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:42"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 43,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:43"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B04",
      "text": "Welche Freigaberegel gilt, ist je Werk gepflegt: Prozentregel oder – auch ungepflegt – absolute Wertgrenze.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap",
          "line": 63,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap:63"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap",
          "line": 66,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap:66"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B05",
      "text": "Nach der absoluten Regel ist eine Position direkt buchbar, wenn der Betrag ihres Differenzwerts die Werksgrenze nicht übersteigt.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap",
          "line": 24,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap:24"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B06",
      "text": "Nach der Prozentregel ist sie direkt buchbar, wenn die Mengenabweichung in Prozent vom Buchbestand die Grenze nicht übersteigt; bei Buchbestand null nie.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap",
          "line": 42,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap:42"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap",
          "line": 44,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap:44"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap",
          "line": 46,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_c01.abap:46"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B07",
      "text": "Direkt buchbare Positionen werden zum Buchen, alle anderen zur Freigabe vorgesehen.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 48,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:48"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 49,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:49"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 51,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:51"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B08",
      "text": "Im Testlauf werden alle Positionen mit Wert und Entscheidung als ALV-Liste angezeigt und nichts gebucht.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap",
          "line": 55,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post.abap:55"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 37,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:37"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B09",
      "text": "Im Echtlauf werden die buchbaren Differenzen je Inventurbeleg gebucht; bei Fehlern wird der Beleg verworfen und als fehlgeschlagen ausgegeben, sonst festgeschrieben und als gebucht ausgegeben.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 57,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:57"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 62,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:62"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 70,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:70"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 71,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:71"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 72,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:72"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 74,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:74"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 77,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:77"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BM-212-B10",
      "text": "Freigabepflichtige Positionen werden mit Anleger und Datum für das Werkscontrolling vorgemerkt.",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 82,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:82"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 86,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:86"
        },
        {
          "file": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap",
          "line": 88,
          "token": null,
          "expressionPath": null,
          "raw": "zmm_pi_diff_post_f01.abap:88"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
